WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
黄昏鸟瞰展示多组概念地标在公共空间中的总体关系。
A dusk aerial view shows the overall relationship among several conceptual landmarks.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.000
“时空之轴”以旧轨道记忆和发光结构形成时间叙事。
The Time Axis combines rail-memory imagery with a luminous structure.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:18.000
“轨道之门”以层叠拱门构成步行入口和到达界面。
The Gate of Rail uses layered arches to form a pedestrian arrival threshold.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:24.000
“自然之息”以绿色综合形体融入林下公共空间。
Nature's Breath places a green sculptural form within a wooded civic space.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:30.040
“创新螺旋”以双螺旋形体收束动态地标叙事。
The Innovation Spiral closes the sequence with a double-helix form.
